entive\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInsidePopup\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BAPopupBody\"><dl class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><dt class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOnly BVDI_BAItemPrizeIncentive\">\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">This review was submitted as a PrizeIncentive<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd>This review was submitted as a PrizeIncentive<\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_b6jadlqyq6ui6etlmxszj9w5d_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_2thnxdnftr5dn6dyhcv960zhz_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">This review was submitted as a PrizeIncentive<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"1 out of 5\" title=\"1 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-60px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">1<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Not worth the price<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">02/15/2026<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2026-02-15\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText416634271_m9ppk0dqc2uulxs0iu77tynwu_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">I\u2019ve had this tiller for 6 months, used it to till a 20x10 space plus a few extra rows and it\u2019s already broken 3 times. Now it seems to be at the point where it\u2019s unfixable. It doesn\u2019t fill well going forward, so you have to go over each row twice<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText416634271_m9ppk0dqc2uulxs0iu77tynwu_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview416634271_eicwglybdnpbunam244dangbb_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview416634271_eicwglybdnpbunam244dangbb_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">I\u2019ve had this tiller for 6 months, used it to till a 20x10 space plus a few extra rows and it\u2019s already broken 3 times. Now it seems to be at the point where it\u2019s unfixable. It doesn\u2019t fill well going forward, so you have to go over each row twice with it really only doing any work as you walk backward. Filters and carb are constantly getting clogged and hard to clean. Issues with the starter and timing and compression. Not worth the price at all.<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText416634271_m9ppk0dqc2uulxs0iu77tynwu_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview416634271_eicwglybdnpbunam244dangbb_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">+<\/span><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">1<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">point<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.u